      <h2>About Forodhani Market (Official)</h2>
      <p>Forodhani Gardens night market in Stone Town is Zanzibar&#x27;s most famous street food destination, transforming the waterfront every evening into a vibrant culinary scene. Locals and visitors gather for grilled lobster, octopus, Zanzibar pizza (a crispy fried parcel with egg, onion, and cheese), sugarcane juice, urojo (Zanzibar mix), and tropical fruit skewers. The market opens around sunset and runs late into the night. A must-visit for food lovers wanting authentic Zanzibari flavors in a spectacular setting overlooking the Indian Ocean.</p>

